    - target: {fileID: 827748465615634449, guid: cb5c9ac9e8c24984f8e52c8939d90f9a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "In the late neolithic age, Boar weren\u2019t hunted often as they didn\u2019t
        provide much that couldn\u2019t be sourced elsewhere with less hassle. As
        opposed to the Auroch however, they could be hunted by a single person, so
        it\u2019s likely they were hunted to demonstrate ability and prestige."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
